<description>&lt;p&gt;Mass killings of Orthodox Christians have resumed in Oromia, with attackers killing at least 60 believers in two separate incidents in the region. Simultaneously, violence in Gambella left 12 dead and more than 80 injured, according to MSF. Over 35,000 Ethiopians have fled across the border into Kenya, intensifying the humanitarian crisis. The UN mission in Somalia has concluded while the UN food programme appointed a new head amid the renewed conflict. 2,824 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9lRnAyWFN6S1Q2cWx6b2pXZk1IblNMX3g0d1lpRXhqYWFPdnp4R3ctUmlnQlcyeUlJM3lldzFKVW9WdENxc21uUm9xOUg2Sy1PYV80U2VvWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE92bm0xcTFfYzhLRmRCUWRZY1hmWUdhOUctX1JVVzFMelFDcUhhZ3NPVDZfcDk3dXR6Q3NuTlh2SmZlR0I4SWYwTzd3eG4wNlBVTVpldVNwb2ZVcmdiYWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQMm42dzVVcUFrTk1iTmVHQWpMdkNBYTNOY1BoWW9PbTBJSnNreU9VQS0tcEZDS2h6cTNtN2gySUthVFFJbFEwc29MVkduYS1CVnFraFNiV1hzaWp3M3VYSXhLT2FJZnFDMkMybUZPYkZacnFRd0RRNnNUZFhrOWtKTE96T3lFejJoR2RJQU5Rdl9mNTZoWlN6aEtTLTdaTDBkM1VVb0RMTGs2NmdBNHlj?oc=5&quot;&gt;PesaCheck&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premier Christian News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTFAzYmRRY01mS0ZkQ3FPRmNYNTJFUi1ac0czVGlZSk1jZUFIV1ZKTGdVZ0RYQndZWklvUmxqRHYyWFNkSEJIWEp2cklGSlkzMFdzcjN6aEdPWlA5ZUxtR1hEOXpGRGpUaVZKQkhkdDBLc3g0RUZmVExTTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hr